# Build and Test

Install developer tooling:

```bash
make setup
```

Build the project:

```bash
make build
```

The default build includes pybind11 Python bindings. You can disable them in an
existing build directory with:

```bash
uv run meson configure build -Dbuild_python_bindings=false
```

Run tests:

```bash
make test
```

Run all local checks:

```bash
make check
```

Build and validate the Python wheel in a clean temporary environment:

```bash
make check-wheel
```
